---
description: ChurchFocus project rules (always on)
alwaysApply: true
---
Before writing code in this repo:
1. Read AGENTS.md, then follow docs/CONVENTIONS.md (rules + definition of done).
2. Use only names from docs/INTERFACES.md and feature ids from contracts/features.yaml. Add any new name to INTERFACES.md in the same change.
3. Research lifecycle, timing and scope rules are in docs/REPAIR_PLAN.md. They supersede docs/REDESIGN.md.
4. Guardrails in docs/PRD.md section 5 are non-negotiable.
5. Never edit a released prompt. Add app/prompts/<name>.vN+1.md and record it in docs/PROMPT_HISTORY.md.
6. Run `python -m pytest -q` (offline, 251+ tests) before saying a task is done. If blocked, reply "blocked: <reason>".
7. Track state in tasks.json ONLY via `python scripts/tasks.py` (set / register / annotate). Never hand-edit it.
8. Check for running research jobs before restarting the live server on port 8000.
